# Frontend
dashboards/web/node_modules/
dashboards/web/dist/
# The live export is regenerated by `make web-data` and would go stale in git.
# public/data-fixtures/ IS committed: it lets CI build, and lets anyone clone the
# repo and see the real dashboard without running Spark.
dashboards/web/public/data/

